---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About Me | Imran Pathan">
  <div class="container section">
    <div class="about-header">
      <h1>About Me</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">Salesforce Developer & Full-Stack Engineer</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="about-content">
      <div class="prose">
        <p>
          I'm Imran Pathan, a Salesforce Developer and software engineer focused on building practical solutions around Salesforce, integrations, full-stack applications, and developer productivity.
        </p>
        <p>
          Over the years, I've worked extensively with Apex, Lightning Web Components, Salesforce automation, APIs, integrations, CI/CD, and Salesforce development tooling.
        </p>
        <p>
          I'm currently expanding my engineering depth into Java, Spring Boot, cloud platforms, data systems, system design, AI agents, and modern developer tooling.
        </p>
        <p>
          My long-term goal is to grow into a Salesforce Solution Architect / Technical Lead while continuing to build products and tools that solve real developer problems.
        </p>
        <p>
          I also enjoy documenting technical concepts and creating practical learning resources for other developers.
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="philosophy">
        <h2>How I Think About Engineering</h2>
        <ul class="principles">
          <li>Prefer simple solutions over unnecessary complexity.</li>
          <li>Understand trade-offs before choosing an architecture.</li>
          <li>Design for failure, not only the happy path.</li>
          <li>Automate repetitive developer work.</li>
          <li>Optimize based on evidence rather than assumptions.</li>
          <li>Treat security and scalability as design concerns.</li>
          <li>Build tools that solve real problems.</li>
          <li>Share knowledge through practical examples.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .section {
    padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
    max-width: 800px;
  }
  
  .about-header {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    padding-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  
  .subtitle {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  
  .about-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 3rem;
  }
  
  .prose p {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--text-color);
  }
  
  .philosophy h2 {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--accent-color);
  }
  
  .principles {
    list-style-type: none;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
  }
  
  .principles li {
    padding: 1rem;
    background-color: var(--card-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--accent-color);
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
</style>
